=== stdout ===
OVERVIEW: Show related Firebase issues and optional Xcode crashes.

USAGE: xcrashlytics groups [--format <format>] [--firebase-limit <firebase-limit>] [<issue>] [--limit <limit>] [--xcode] [--crash-directory <crash-directory> ...] [--since <since>]

ARGUMENTS:
  <issue>                 Optional Firebase issue id, for example FB-ISSUE_ID.

OPTIONS:
  --format <format>       Output format: text (default) or json. (values: text,
                          json, ndjson; default: text)
  --firebase-limit <firebase-limit>
                          Maximum number of Firebase issues to fetch. (default:
                          100)
  --limit <limit>         Limit to N groups.
  --xcode                 Include local crash reports downloaded by the Xcode
                          Organizer.
  --crash-directory <crash-directory>
                          Xcode crash directory to scan. Repeatable.
  --since <since>         Firebase window for event and user totals, e.g. 7d
                          (default), 30d, 90d, or all (90d).
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

